Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:22.13,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:29.14,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A heat source?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:38.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's thatk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:41.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Sovereign Degwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we can achieve peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:44.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sovereign Degwin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:45.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's where the Revil Fleet's\Nmain forces are located!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Not all of them are gone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not all of them are gone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Solar Ray has been fired at Gel Dorva!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you heard that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you check the laser sensors?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I heard, all right.\NDid you hear at your station, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're at level two battle stations.\NIdle chatter is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Great Degwin's identification signal\Nwas detected at the Gel Dorva line...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:14.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Great Degwin...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:20.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. And it was at the exact same point\Nthat the enemy fleet was situated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:23.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were we notified about the Great Degwin\Nheading into battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:24.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maintain surveillance\Non the enemy's remaining forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt we wiped out even half of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Great Degwin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Only the Saffron is left\Nfrom the 12th Division!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have only 8 ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8} The Cisco's damaged too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some of them are damaged quite badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any word from the Luzal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main fleet has been ordered\Nto gather around the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:00.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we're to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Have you heard anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing! They seem to be\Nin a state of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attention White Base crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone stand by at level 2 battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you figure anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They used something like the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Solar System?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation used it at Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although this one's much more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}White Base! Security code Beta Trois!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My brave and loyal Zeon soldiers...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Half of the Federation fleet has been{\i}\N{\i1}reduced to stardust by our Solar Ray!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This brilliant light is proof{\i}\N{\i1}that the Zeon cause is just!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the massive damage that{\i}\N{\i1}the Federation Forces have sustained...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...no matter how much fighting strength{\i}\N{\i1}they may have left...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...It Is of little consequence.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dare I say it.{\i}\N{\i1}They are merely debris!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I declare it impossible...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:58.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...for this weak host of enemies{\i}\N{\i1}to force its way past A Baoa Qu.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Under the control of we, the chosen\Nsuperior race of Zeon, humanity can...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...at last ensure its eternal survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this war drags on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it will pose a threat to humanity itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must teach the incompetents\Nof the Earth Federation a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now is the time for humanity...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...to stand and face\Nthe future that awaits us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second and third battalions\Nwill advance from N Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will gather all remaining ships,\Nwith the Luzal as our flagship...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and proceed from S Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We obviously lack fighting strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only we could use our Solar System too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:57.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:06:02.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true that A Baoa Qu's firepower\Nis greatest where we want to attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:04.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but it's also their weakest point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The operation will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that Newtype intuition?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to synchronize timers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1... 0! Operation starting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands go to level 1 battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll break through the F-line in 10 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give up hope, no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't waste our lives over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the Fraw Bow I know.\NWell, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, don't do anything crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:42.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're heading back to E-Block!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:53.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's stuck on Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, good for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a creepy laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not hurting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:15.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you said back there... Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Newtypes could predict the future,\Nthen we all wouldn't have to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Amuro hadn't said what he did,\Nthe crew would've abandoned ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From fear, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans can't become gods\Neven if they try with all their might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy's creating a\Nbeam interference field...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Respond with missiles.\NDon't move our mobile suits yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The carrier Dolos is on schedule.\NHold off for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reroute half the vessels in S Field\Nover to N Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damned Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad for having lost their main forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:41.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gwazine entering E Field.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's likely Rear Admiral Kycilia's vessel.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Reroute it now to N Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doesn't match the number of ships\Nthat Kycilia set out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every one of the new Gelgoog types\Nhas been dispatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left for me to pilot, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want to try out the Zeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand it's only\N80 percent complete, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zeong...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mobile suit that partially...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...incorporates the psycommu system\Ndeveloped for the Elmeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be able to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:33.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it has the Braw Bro's characteristics?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone has launched in the Zeong.\NGive it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, I'll go see Gihren.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:44.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,80 percent, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Magellan-class destroyed, sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy mobile suit forces have launched.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:25.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright, Dolos. Don't fail me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lady Kycilia has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize profusely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that the Elmeth was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it couldn't even handle a single Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll use the Zeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That incomplete model?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat the Gundam unless\Nwe use somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...who might be a Newtype.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char... once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dolos is advancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Great Degwin. Where is it deployed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it at Zum City?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:11:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was destroyed.\NIt moved out too far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Did Sovereign Degwin\Nlend you his ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kycilia. Do you think our father\Nwould hand over the Great Degwin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then there's your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our forces are simply overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,80 percent complete?\NYou've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In its current state,\Nthe Zeong can fight at 100 percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it has no legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Legs are just for show!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The brass doesn't understand things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You explained how to operate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the psycommu...\NDo you think I can handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Newtype abilities\Nare unknown, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I can't guarantee anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're very frank. I don't appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it makes you feel any better, Captain,\NI'm sure you'll do well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:05.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like your numbers are\Ntoo small to attack us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:45.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Dolos is holding its ground quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send all N Field fleets forward and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A new fleet? A Federation Forces one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:51.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's in the N Field line.\NWe're gathering data now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:58.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation's fighting well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's merely the last futile effort of\Ntheir surviving forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:07.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the status of Captain Char's Zeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's the Zeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's good to go.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then... A new enemy fleet\Nwas discovered in S Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go after them with\Nthe 34th Mobile Suit Corps!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, Ma'am! We'll take out{\i}\N{\i1}all the enemy entering S Field!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation won't have\Nany more forces in reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should be able to defend S Field\Nwith our current strength, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:40.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A man who killed his own father...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now. The question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...whether or not I actually have\Ndefinite Newtype potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elevate 2 degrees! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there! A mobile suit team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.79,0:16:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy's strong! Is it Char?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's behind me?! What the...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Newtype who's stronger than Char! But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But landing on A Baoa Qu\Nis more important now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My true enemy is within there.\NAnd it's not Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Dolos forces\Nwill take care of N Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Father was aboard the Great Degwin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yet you destroyed it along\Nwith the Federation Forces. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing would have resulted from\Nan ill-timed peace initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there was no need to let him die...\N"Supreme Commander".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough of the jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How surprisingly naive, my dear brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:54.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Supreme Commander Gihren?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:57.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get rid of the body now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even a supreme commander\Ncan't get away with patricide!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If any of you disagree, you can\Nfile charges after the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander Gihren\Ndied honorably in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Dolos fleet has been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lady Kycilia, your orders...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Twanning. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take over command of A Baoa Qu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dispatch mobile suit forces to N Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the status of S Field?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've eliminated\N10 of the enemy's 25 vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the other vessels are\Nhanging on in S Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send Char's Zeong to the front line!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Concentrate mobile suit forces in S Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go...!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're mine...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those new models are quite something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell Sayla to keep her G-Fighter\Nnear the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai! The enemy's defense seemed\Nto weaken momentarily just then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. That was rather strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We may be struggling,\Nbut from the looks of it, so are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:19:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic. I've lost sight of the Gundam.\NWhere is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy mobile suits\Nhave landed in N Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm. That's a concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's S Field holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Gundam\Nhas broken through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Char's Zeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:54.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Obstructed by the enemy,\Nand can't get close to the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's his first time in the Zeong, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Char! I think he found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see him! I can see my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:22.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the Gelgoogs and Doms aren't\Ndoing well. Why is that, Twanning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ma'am! It appears that many\Nof the pilots are student recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Students?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. But I assure you,\Nthey've been fully trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's the outcome I'm concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems they're just too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:42.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But their patriotic spirit is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.41,0:21:46.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only the Supreme Commander had\Ntaken notice of Newtypes earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Draw the enemy into A Baoa Qu\Nso we can pick them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't too many of the enemy left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotta do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.65,0:21:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to show up here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:07.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mother...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the other direction?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He dodged me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:41.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not again...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char was beginning to feel intense alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Zeong had been\Ndeveloped for Newtypes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and he was frustrated by his inability\Nto draw out its full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gundam pilot was unquestionably\Ndriving him into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:58.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But surely I must be a Newtype too...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:19.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The finale is at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:24.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro and Char duel without mobile suits.\NThis is no longer a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It must be the fate imposed on Newtypes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, the red flames of A Baoa Qu\Nengulf the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NEscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.16,0:23:41.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
